<title>NEW ZEALAND: Infratil exercises option on CentralPower.</title>
<headline>Infratil exercises option on CentralPower.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utilities investor Infrastructure &amp; Utilities NZ (Infratil) said on Tuesday it had exercised its &quot;top-up&quot; option resulting from CentralPower Ltd's merger with Electro Power Ltd.</p>
<p>Accordingly, Infratil has taken up 2,078,457 additional CentralPower shares at an average price of $3.03 per share, it reported to the New Zealand Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
